       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-LYAPUNOV-NEGATIVE-ABSENCE-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-EXCLUDED-VULNERABILITIES.
           05  WS-NO-UNBOUNDED-DIVERGENCE  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NO-STATE-ESCAPE-LEAK     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NO-LIMIT-CYCLE-CHAOS     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-NO-RE-ENTRANCY-BREACH    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-SAFETY-PROOFS-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-SAFETY-INVARIANT-MET     PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-ABSENCE-CODE       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-VERIFY-ABSENCE-OF-CHAOS.
           PERFORM 2000-VERIFY-ABSENCE-OF-LEAKS.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-SAFETY.
           GOBACK.
       1000-VERIFY-ABSENCE-OF-CHAOS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NO-UNBOUNDED-DIVERGENCE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NO-LIMIT-CYCLE-CHAOS.
       2000-VERIFY-ABSENCE-OF-LEAKS.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NO-STATE-ESCAPE-LEAK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-NO-RE-ENTRANCY-BREACH.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-SAFETY.
           IF WS-NO-UNBOUNDED-DIVERGENCE = 1 AND
              WS-NO-STATE-ESCAPE-LEAK = 1 AND
              WS-NO-LIMIT-CYCLE-CHAOS = 1 AND
              WS-NO-RE-ENTRANCY-BREACH = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-SAFETY-INVARIANT-MET
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-ABSENCE-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-SAFETY-INVARIANT-MET
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-ABSENCE-CODE.
